  textIngles: Do you see the wall behind me? , if you look carefully there are some
    small cracks in that wall, you have the ability to go through them.
  textEspanol: "\xBFVes la pared que hay detr\xE1s m\xEDo?, si observas bien hay
    unas peque\xF1as grietas en esa pared, tu tienes la habilidad de atravesarlas."
  textCatalan: "Veus la paret que hi ha darrere meu?, si observes b\xE9 hi ha unes
    petites esquerdes en aquesta paret, tu tens l'habilitat de travessar-les."
